KAPP1
name=Kreative Guide
version=1
---
KREATIVE GUIDE

Your workspace, your ideas.

FILES
Select a document to open it in Notes.
Use Terminal to create or remove files.

NOTES
Type text and choose SAVE. Data is committed to the dedicated KFS disk.

BROWSER
Enter an HTTP URL or file:Readme.html.
Press Enter to load. Arrow keys scroll.

PACKAGES
Install local .kapp documents. Installed apps appear in the launcher.

SNAKE
Arrow keys steer. Space starts a new game.
